<title>UK: Lehman appoints new London debt syndicate head.</title>
<headline>Lehman appoints new London debt syndicate head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers has appointed Christian Wait to be head of London syndicate with immediate effect, it said on Friday.</p>
<p>Wait, who has been with Lehman Brothers since 1985, was previously based in New York where he was global head of money markets, medium term notes and the floating rate note business.</p>
<p>He will report to Bob Kiernan, head of European syndicate and debt capital markets.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
